{
 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "c07-title-01",
   "scene": "c07-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter seven. Three places, one table.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-01",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here is the whole lesson in one table. What is the pronoun joined to? What is its job? What place is it in?",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "b:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-02",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Joined to a noun, it is the owner, in the place of jarr. His book.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-03",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "كِتَابُهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:كِتَابُهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-04",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Joined to a preposition, its job is called after a preposition. It is in the place of jarr. On it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-05",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلَيْهِ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:عَلَيْهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-06",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Joined to a past or order verb, it is the object, in the place of naṣb. He opened it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-07",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فَتَحَهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فَتَحَهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-08",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And with an order verb, read it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-09",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِقْرَأْهُ",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": [
    "ar:اِقْرَأْهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-01",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In short.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "b:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-02",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "There are twelve attached pronouns. One for I, one for we, five for you, and five for he, she and they.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "li:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-03",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On a noun, the pronoun is the owner, in the place of jarr. The noun loses al and tanween.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "li:1",
    "ar:ال"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-04",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "After a preposition, it is in the place of jarr. On it, to you, for him.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "li:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-05",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "عَلَيْهِ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "ar:عَلَيْهِ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-06",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "إِلَيْكَ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "ar:إِلَيْكَ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-07",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "لَهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:لَهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-08",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "On a verb, it is the object, in the place of naṣb. He opened it.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "li:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-09",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "فَتَحَهُ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "ar:فَتَحَهُ"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-10",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The pronoun for he",
   "pause": 0.15,
   "cues": [
    "li:4",
    "ar:ـهُ#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-11",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "changes its damma to a kasra after a kasra or this letter.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ي"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-12",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And before the pronoun for me, the noun's ending is hidden.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "ar:ـي#2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-summary-13",
   "scene": "c07-summary",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Well done. Now open the Practice tab and try it yourself.",
   "pause": 1.0,
   "cues": []
  }
 ]
}